  "question": {
    "text": "The function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>}</mo><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>; defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math> the highest prime factor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>, is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
